{
  "inShort": "The devlog and available artifacts leave the playable slice at risk. No accessible build or five-player test results were shared. Mia did not confirm work this week, leaving only Alex’s 10–15 weekly hours confirmed for the slice.",
  "discussed": [
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtkfvkg08t8nxz8v55cyzd7",
      "text": "The public Godot demo repository matches the task. It contains demo folders, an MIT license and import instructions, not evidence of this game’s slice."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtkfvop08t9nxz8eq2wcl2h",
      "text": "The animated art-style reference remains done. Only the Big Buck Bunny title and thumbnail were checked, so the animation itself was not verified."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtkfvsb08tanxz8bbdrwz5d",
      "text": "The playtesting reference matches the task. Wikipedia’s article explains playtesting and testing formats, but does not document tests of this game."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtkfvu308tbnxz8zjhu1ed9",
      "text": "The private design board is recorded as done. No inspection result or new board artifact was supplied this sprint."
    }
  ],
  "notDiscussed": [
    "cmvtkfvux08tcnxz8u08axfq7"
  ],
  "outsidePlan": [
    "The devlog reports a second island and reef damage, both relevant to the slice. The landscape photo and Big Buck Bunny preview demonstrate neither change. No new artifact closes that evidence gap."
  ],
  "questions": [
    "Is there an accessible build showing two islands, the tide loop and co-op sailing?",
    "Have five players tested that build, and where are their findings recorded?",
    "How many hours can Mia confirm for the remaining two weeks?"
  ]
}

